    <h1>Artmaking</h1>
    <p style="max-inline-size: var(--inline-size)">I make things out of words (poems and essays) and pixels (photography, code and net art). I also dabble in the art of getting people together to share ideas. This is a selection of my work from the last 11 years.</p>
    <p style="max-inline-size: var(--inline-size)">Most of it starts with noticing something that's been hiding in plain sight. An everyday place, a passing thought, someone who doesn't often get heard. Sometimes I reframe it. Sometimes I document it just as it is, to understand it better myself and to share it with more people. A photo of a seafront is only a photo of a seafront, until it reminds someone what they love about where they live. The things I'm drawn to have usually been standing there all along. I just want us to look at them for a moment, and talk about them.</p>
